    Step 3 — Extract the ZIP
    Extract the downloaded ZIP somewhere temporary, for example:

    C:\temp\pgvector\

    Inside it, you should find files including:

    vector.dll
    vector.control
    vector--0.8.6.sql
    ...

    The exact SQL migration files may vary with the pgvector version.

    Step 4 — Copy vector.dll
    Copy:

    vector.dll

    to:

    C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\16\lib\

    So you should have:

    C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\16\lib\vector.dll

    Step 5 — Copy the extension files
    Copy:

    vector.control
    vector--*.sql

    to:

    C:\Program Files\PostgreSQL\16\share\extension\

